From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:51:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: apple,s8003-gpu: Add the A7 (S5L8960X) GPU

The A7's GPU, a G6430 (Apple's G3, HAL G3_B0 in Apple's kernel), is a
Rogue core behind the same Fender block as the A8's and A9's, and Apple's
kernel runs a META LDR firmware on it (AGXFirmwareKextG3). Apple's device
trees (iOS 12.5.8, J71, J85, N51) give it the A8's and A9's two register
ranges and five interrupts, the fifth the firmware's (the second of the
ADT's meta-sw-interrupt tuples, AIC 88), and power gate 0x7c, which is
ps_gfx. Allow "apple,s5l8960x-gpu" with the A9's shape: the core, Fender
and that power domain.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-gpu.yaml         | 33 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 32 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-gpu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-gpu.yaml
index 6521f0821..18396ab24 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-gpu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-gpu.yaml
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/gpu/apple,s8003-gpu.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Apple S8000/S8003 (A9) and T7000 (A8) GPU
+title: Apple S8000/S8003 (A9), T7000 (A8) and S5L8960X (A7) GPU
 
 maintainers:
   - Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
@@ -21,10 +21,17 @@ description: |
   enables, and the two bus bridges in front of the GPU, so the node names
   those registers instead of a power domain.
 
+  The A7's GPU (G6430, Apple's G3, revision B0 in Apple's
+  AppleEmbeddedGPUDrivers HAL) sits at the same addresses behind the same
+  Fender block, and Apple's kernel runs a META LDR firmware on it too
+  (AGXFirmwareKextG3). Its node has the A9's shape: the Rogue core, Fender
+  and the power manager's GFX power domain.
+
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
+          - apple,s5l8960x-gpu
           - apple,s8003-gpu
           - apple,t7000-gpu
       - items:
@@ -148,3 +155,27 @@ examples:
             firmware-name = "apple/gfx-t7000.bin";
         };
     };
+
+  - |
+    #include <dt-bindings/interrupt-controller/apple-aic.h>
+    #include <dt-bindings/interrupt-controller/irq.h>
+
+    soc {
+        #address-cells = <2>;
+        #size-cells = <2>;
+
+        gpu@201000000 {
+            compatible = "apple,s5l8960x-gpu";
+            reg = <0x2 0x01000000 0x0 0x100000>,
+                  <0x2 0x01e00000 0x0 0x100000>;
+            reg-names = "rgx", "fender";
+            power-domains = <&ps_gfx>;
+            interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
+            interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 84 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+                         <AIC_IRQ 85 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+                         <AIC_IRQ 86 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+                         <AIC_IRQ 87 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+                         <AIC_IRQ 88 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+            firmware-name = "apple/gfx-s5l8960x.bin";
+        };
+    };
